This gets back to the whole issue of not why women are not interested
in science and technology, but why women are not _really interested_
in science and technology in the same way men are. Boys get really
excited by science....at least I did, and I'll bet most of you did,
too.

For some reason, which I don't think is cultural, girls are not
excited by these things. They may be good students, etc., but fewer of
